OL,3,GNEWSABiffy Clyro, Blossoms and Jamie T 
OL,4,Atop Truck 2027 bill                    
OL,6,FScottish rockers Biffy Clyro, indie    
OL,7,Ficon Jamie T and chart toppers Blossoms
OL,8,Fwill headline next year's Truck        
OL,9,FFestival.                              
OL,11,FThey're joined on the bill by Thursday 
OL,12,Fnight headliners Bastille, as well as  
OL,13,Fthe Sugababes, Supergrass and          
OL,14,FVengaboys.                             
OL,16,FOther acts performing over the weekend 
OL,17,Finclude Declan McKenna, La Roux,       
OL,18,FKingfishr, Inhaler, DMA's, Holly       
OL,19,FHumberstone and Sports Team.           
