OL,3,GNEWSABiffy Clyro, Blossoms and Jamie T 
OL,4,Atop Truck 2027 bill                    
OL,6,FThe Oxfordshire festival takes place at
OL,7,FHill Farm in Steventon from 22 to 25   
OL,8,FJuly 2027, and follows a               
OL,9,Frecord-breaking 2026 edition.          
